<title>POLAND: Animex signs $27 mln imports contract.</title>
<headline>Animex signs $27 mln imports contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Animex SA has signed a contract under which it will import products for fat- and oil-industry firms worth $27 million in the first half of 1997, it said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
